SLOG001 Log events should be snake_case string literals, with data passed as keyword arguments
 --> structured_logging.py:6:10
  |
5 | log.info("payment_failed", order_id=1)  # OK
6 | log.info(f"payment {1} failed")
  |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
7 | log.warning("Payment failed for %s", 1)
8 | log.error("PaymentFailed")
  |

SLOG001 Log events should be snake_case string literals, with data passed as keyword arguments
